Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=2}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 50,0:01:28.82,0:01:31.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell is he doing over there?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:31.45,0:01:34.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,C'mon just humor the poor guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.25,0:01:36.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He has too much pride to\Nshow his face to the crew,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.66,0:01:37.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but he still wants\Nto rescue his friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.66,0:01:44.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well long as he\Nstops singing, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.96,0:01:45.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.50,0:01:46.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get over here!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:46.80,0:01:49.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Oh, sure.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:53.38,0:01:57.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's start the meeting for\N"Operation Rescue Robin."
Dialogue: 50,0:01:57.76,0:01:59.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've never met before.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:59.16,0:02:01.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't you two have any questions about me?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:01.73,0:02:05.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So the car you were\Nin was car number 6.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:05.06,0:02:07.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That means that we've got five more left.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:07.07,0:02:09.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Y'know, like\N"where's Sniper Island?"
Dialogue: 50,0:02:09.47,0:02:11.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But we don't know which one of those Robin\Nis in.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:11.80,0:02:15.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The answer is:\NIt's in your heart.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:15.16,0:02:17.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And by the way are you strong?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:18.15,0:02:20.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding,\NI'm super strong!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:20.45,0:02:22.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even stronger than usual this week!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:22.29,0:02:26.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Remember, the point is to rescue Robin,\Nnot beat the enemy.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:26.49,0:02:28.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Least in theory.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:28.73,0:02:29.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're up against\Na lot of Marines,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.26,0:02:30.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,in a narrow space
Dialogue: 50,0:02:30.12,0:02:32.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so we gotta make sure\Nwe don't get surrounded.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:33.90,0:02:35.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We should avoid as\Nmany fights as we can,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.94,0:02:37.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and whittle down the\Nmain force in turns.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:37.85,0:02:40.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here we go, listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.63,0:02:44.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:44.47,0:02:47.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now I'm ready for battle!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:47.27,0:02:48.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm? What's going on?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:48.64,0:02:50.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't you play innocent with me,\Nimmoral girl!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:50.87,0:02:52.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Have you no shame,\Nchanging your clothes
Dialogue: 50,0:02:52.41,0:02:54.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,out here in front of everyone?!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:54.88,0:02:57.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Shame is overrated.\N– Shame is overrated.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:58.65,0:02:59.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What was I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:59.98,0:03:01.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The train only has one car!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:01.95,0:03:03.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cover up your legs!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:03.32,0:03:04.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cover up your stomach!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:04.58,0:03:06.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That goes for you too,\NSquare-Head-Sisters!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:06.66,0:03:09.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,People like you are corrupting society!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:09.26,0:03:11.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whatever, you're just too shy.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:11.66,0:03:13.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shy boy!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:13.23,0:03:14.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why, you!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:14.16,0:03:18.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stupid black shorts with their stupid tiny\Npockets!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:18.07,0:03:21.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on get in there!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:22.52,0:03:24.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't put meat in your pants, you idiot!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:24.71,0:03:27.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to think you\Nmight actually pull this off!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:27.71,0:03:30.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You certainly seem\Nriled up, if nothing else!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:30.28,0:03:31.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You bet we are!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:31.54,0:03:33.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those jerks got away\Nwith Robin last time,
Dialogue: 50,0:03:33.54,0:03:34.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but now that\NI know what's going on,
Dialogue: 50,0:03:34.93,0:03:36.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,they don't stand a chance!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:36.62,0:03:37.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I hope you're right!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:37.87,0:03:39.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Cause if you get stuck\Nin something again,
Dialogue: 50,0:03:39.57,0:03:41.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you're gonna have hell to pay!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:41.30,0:03:42.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nah, don't worry,
Dialogue: 50,0:03:42.81,0:03:45.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I got a reason to beat\Nthem this time around!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:45.52,0:03:47.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.48,0:03:48.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:48.60,0:03:49.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did you change\Nyour weapon, Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.97,0:03:50.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:50.64,0:03:51.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:51.78,0:03:53.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's pretty much the same one as before.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:53.94,0:03:55.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp just improved\Nit with some dials
Dialogue: 50,0:03:55.69,0:03:57.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,after we got back from Skypeia.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:58.13,0:04:00.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is the Perfect Clima Takt.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:00.57,0:04:01.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:01.60,0:04:02.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So that's his...
Dialogue: 50,0:04:02.84,0:04:03.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:03.47,0:04:04.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's Usopp's...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.54,0:04:05.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 50,0:04:05.94,0:04:09.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Last work...
Dialogue: 50,0:04:10.61,0:04:12.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't get all sad now!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:22.07,0:04:23.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You ready?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:23.31,0:04:25.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's do this.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:27.08,0:04:28.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,An intruder?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:29.12,0:04:29.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh, yes, sir.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:29.82,0:04:31.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's what I heard.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:31.94,0:04:35.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not feasible to board the\NPuffing Tom while it's running.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:35.48,0:04:37.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If there really is\Nan intruder that means
Dialogue: 50,0:04:37.17,0:04:39.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we let him sneak on\Nboard before we departed.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:40.34,0:04:41.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What an embarrassment.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:43.01,0:04:45.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I agree, sir.\NIt's inexcusable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.49,0:04:46.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But if you can't get on
Dialogue: 50,0:04:46.90,0:04:49.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,while the train is moving,\Nyou can't get off, either.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:49.51,0:04:50.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That means the intruder as well
Dialogue: 50,0:04:50.96,0:04:53.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,as the missing prisoners\Nare still here somewhere.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:53.73,0:04:55.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You just have to find them.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:55.67,0:04:57.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1983)}Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:13.46,0:05:14.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain T-Bone.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:15.19,0:05:18.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't think there's any room for someone\Nto hide in here.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:22.78,0:05:25.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Good evening!\N– Good evening!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:26.92,0:05:28.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– It's them!\N– It's them!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:28.12,0:05:29.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They were right outside!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:29.39,0:05:31.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We found 3 suspicious men,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:31.19,0:05:33.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,including the\Ncriminals in car 7!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:33.36,0:05:37.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Corner and capture them!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:37.20,0:05:39.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ever use a hammer before?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:39.03,0:05:40.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Cause you sure do suck.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:40.31,0:05:41.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sh-Shut up!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:41.33,0:05:42.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no point in resisting!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:42.95,0:05:44.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Open the door already!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:45.99,0:05:47.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're gonna break through!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:47.89,0:05:50.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:50.04,0:05:51.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This way!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:51.12,0:05:52.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They found the\Nintruder in car #7!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:53.02,0:05:54.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The criminals, too?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:54.41,0:05:55.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:55.14,0:05:56.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let the guys in car 3 know.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:56.43,0:05:58.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That Franky guy's\Na lot of trouble.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:58.90,0:06:01.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Move in and capture them alive!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:01.75,0:06:03.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Move it! Stand back!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:05.62,0:06:06.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:06.32,0:06:07.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're shooting at us!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:07.16,0:06:08.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then hurry it up!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:08.47,0:06:10.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A little help would be nice!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:14.28,0:06:15.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't shoot blindly!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:15.40,0:06:18.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We don't want these guys dead!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:18.77,0:06:20.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:20.77,0:06:22.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What do we do, Captain T-Bone?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:22.77,0:06:25.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Allow me to handle this.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:29.91,0:06:32.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I hate crooked men and crooked swordplay.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:33.88,0:06:36.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Here comes my Right-Angle Flash!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.50,0:06:41.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Bone Soir!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:52.06,0:06:54.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're gone!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:55.29,0:06:56.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The roof?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:11.64,0:07:13.80,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,They're at the end of the train!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:14.44,0:07:16.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now! Hurry!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:19.21,0:07:20.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh no.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:21.46,0:07:23.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone get back to the front cars right\Nnow!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:23.92,0:07:25.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is a trap!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:25.73,0:07:28.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:28.10,0:07:28.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the?!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:28.87,0:07:30.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Quick! Retreat-they tricked us!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:30.74,0:07:32.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:32.08,0:07:33.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't go back anymore.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:33.35,0:07:34.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The door is blocked.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:34.68,0:07:35.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:36.68,0:07:38.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The cars are detached!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:40.87,0:07:42.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– What?!\N– What?!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:43.01,0:07:43.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:43.84,0:07:45.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's cheating!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:45.14,0:07:47.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for this!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:49.50,0:07:51.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was too late.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:51.56,0:07:53.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Have a safe trip, gentlemen!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:53.33,0:07:55.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Say hello to the Sea Kings for me!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:55.93,0:07:58.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fair thee well!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:00.10,0:08:01.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's two cars down!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:01.74,0:08:04.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Should cut the small fries\Ndown by about 50 or so.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:04.71,0:08:07.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But aren't Luffy and the others coming on\Nthe same railway?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:07.38,0:08:09.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What happens when the cars run into each\Nother?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:09.92,0:08:12.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eh, they'll come\Nup with something.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:13.22,0:08:14.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You arrogant thugs.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:14.30,0:08:17.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna tear this door down and you with\Nit!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:20.18,0:08:20.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:20.88,0:08:22.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Going for a swim?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:25.81,0:08:29.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right five to go!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:29.51,0:08:30.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You bastard.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:30.62,0:08:32.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're gonna suffer for that one!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:32.24,0:08:34.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What will poor\NCaptain T-Bone do?!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:34.74,0:08:35.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:35.54,0:08:36.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Report this to CP9!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:36.74,0:08:38.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Great, more of these guys.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:43.38,0:08:46.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}And Frites Assorties!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:49.09,0:08:53.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Sniper King Gunpowder Star!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:54.62,0:08:58.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Strong Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.86,0:09:03.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:03.43,0:09:05.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Heavy weight shot fire!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:07.65,0:09:08.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa! They hit him!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:16.07,0:09:17.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That hurt.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:18.44,0:09:20.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Keep shooting!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:26.81,0:09:29.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why isn't the gun\Nworking on him?!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:41.60,0:09:44.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that was crazy.\NWhat the hell are you?!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:44.50,0:09:45.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:45.73,0:09:48.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh guess I forgot to\Ntell you, I'm a cyborg.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:48.87,0:09:50.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those are real?!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:50.19,0:09:51.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:51.34,0:09:54.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I got steel and weapons built right into\Nmy body.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:54.18,0:09:55.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It still kinda\Nhurts if I get shot
Dialogue: 50,0:09:55.88,0:09:58.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and I might bleed a little, too.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:58.11,0:09:59.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But no big deal.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:59.97,0:10:02.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just when you think\Nyou've seen it all!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:02.04,0:10:03.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The world's a crazy place.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:03.62,0:10:05.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.70,0:10:07.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Poke.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.46,0:10:09.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Auuughhh!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:09.40,0:10:11.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What in the hell was that for?!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:11.53,0:10:12.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:12.58,0:10:13.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can deflect bullets, but needles hurt?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:13.99,0:10:15.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For one, I'm not\Nyour science experiment,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.62,0:10:16.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so stop poking me!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:16.96,0:10:18.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And for two, just so you know,
Dialogue: 50,0:10:18.68,0:10:20.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,my back isn't the\Nsame as my front!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:21.02,0:10:22.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get it?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:22.12,0:10:23.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I had to do the\Noperation on myself,
Dialogue: 50,0:10:23.45,0:10:25.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so I couldn't reach\Naround behind me.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:25.45,0:10:28.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In other words, only\Nthe front side is cyborg!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:28.60,0:10:31.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,While I'm at it, lemme tell\Nyou another little secret.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:31.47,0:10:33.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My belly is always cold.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:33.27,0:10:34.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can you guess why?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:34.81,0:10:35.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How would I know?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:35.84,0:10:38.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's 'cause I got\Nmy own personal fridge
Dialogue: 50,0:10:38.14,0:10:40.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,in there to keep my cola cool!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:40.11,0:10:41.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's handy!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:41.52,0:10:43.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Man, that's gotta be great in the summer!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:44.58,0:10:45.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, the cola\Nthing is really neat,
Dialogue: 50,0:10:45.91,0:10:47.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but we don't have time for this!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:47.32,0:10:50.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We gotta get moving\Nto the next car!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:51.42,0:10:53.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This one is number 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.43,0:10:58.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:04.69,0:11:05.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm Wanze!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:06.10,0:11:07.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a mad, mad, mad, mad, world
Dialogue: 50,0:11:07.67,0:11:10.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and I'm a mad, mad,\Nmad, mad, Wanze!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:13.38,0:11:16.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here I come!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:21.06,0:11:22.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's up you guys?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:22.65,0:11:23.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you hungry?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:23.55,0:11:24.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You look hungry.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:24.25,0:11:25.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How 'bout some ramen?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:25.45,0:11:26.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm the head\Nsteward of this train
Dialogue: 50,0:11:26.85,0:11:29.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so I can cook anything you\Nfellas would like to eat.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:29.10,0:11:30.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, ramen it is,
Dialogue: 50,0:11:30.50,0:11:32.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but before I start,\Na little trivia for you.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:33.09,0:11:34.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My nose hairs're\Nshaped like this!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:35.82,0:11:36.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They crisscross inside
Dialogue: 50,0:11:36.74,0:11:38.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so they look just like\Nfishnet stockings.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:38.74,0:11:40.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is very important!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:40.98,0:11:43.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,First I grab the flour.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:43.05,0:11:48.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And knead it in\Nmy mouth like this.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:56.05,0:11:57.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Done! Here!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:57.82,0:12:00.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Hell, no!\N– Hell, no!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:00.65,0:12:02.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, that was a waste of time.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:02.86,0:12:05.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Listen we've got someone\Nwaiting on us, Wanze.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:05.89,0:12:09.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll have to enjoy that nose ramen on\Nyour own.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:09.16,0:12:10.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.66,0:12:12.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you wanna pass\Nthrough this car,
Dialogue: 50,0:12:12.80,0:12:15.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you'll have to defeat me first!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:20.76,0:12:22.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You think {\i1}you{\i0} can stop us?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:22.81,0:12:24.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know I can!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:24.11,0:12:25.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:25.88,0:12:28.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is an important\Nescort mission
Dialogue: 50,0:12:28.18,0:12:32.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so they got an important guy\Nlike me to keep the train safe!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:33.33,0:12:35.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you wanna rescue\Nthat friend of yours
Dialogue: 50,0:12:35.24,0:12:39.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,then first you'll have\Nto defeat my Ramen Kenpo!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:39.66,0:12:41.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ra-Ramen Kenpo?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.57,0:12:43.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ra-Ramen Kenpooooo?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:45.01,0:12:47.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That little turd is making fun of me!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:47.73,0:12:50.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know he's annoying, but you gotta keep\Nyour cool!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:50.03,0:12:51.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How'd you like my\Nidiot imitation,
Dialogue: 50,0:12:51.90,0:12:54.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,was it dumb enough for you?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:54.87,0:12:56.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't let him get to you!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:56.24,0:12:58.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:58.21,0:13:01.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This dude got ants in his pants or what?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:07.45,0:13:10.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I swear that I grazed him\Nwith one of those shots.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:10.52,0:13:11.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But he doesn't even care!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:11.82,0:13:13.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He even looks happy!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:13.83,0:13:16.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought my heart was\Ngonna leap outta my chest!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:16.16,0:13:17.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How was I supposed\Nto know you make
Dialogue: 50,0:13:17.44,0:13:19.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that same stupid face\Nfor everything!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:19.34,0:13:21.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– I'll take this guy down, just watch.\N– I'll take this guy down, just watch.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:21.95,0:13:23.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:23.25,0:13:25.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't let this clown get under your\Nskin.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:25.48,0:13:29.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We got more important things to\Ndo than sit here and play games.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:29.12,0:13:31.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You stay back and\NI'll make quick work of him.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:32.59,0:13:35.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know what your deal is,\Nbut if you were a real chef,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:35.08,0:13:38.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you'd conduct yourself\Nwith a little more dignity.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:40.22,0:13:41.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm talking to you, stupid!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:41.88,0:13:45.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why don't you take your own\Nadvice for once?!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:47.06,0:13:47.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:48.89,0:13:51.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He dodged that kick without even blinking!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:51.69,0:13:54.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In fact, he even looks happy!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:54.70,0:13:56.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought I was gonna die!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:56.16,0:13:57.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop making that damn face!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:57.63,0:14:00.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't do the same joke twice!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:06.88,0:14:08.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've had enough.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:11.62,0:14:14.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like I said, this guy is mine.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:14.82,0:14:15.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You go ahead.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:15.99,0:14:18.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll catch up with you two later.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:20.25,0:14:23.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So you're saying the rear\Ntwo cars were detached?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:23.18,0:14:26.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How could you allow something like this to\Nhappen?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:26.15,0:14:28.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My deepest apologies,\Nma'am but in our defense,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:28.26,0:14:30.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,even Captain T-Bone got\Ntrapped in one of those cars,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:30.99,0:14:32.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and you know how powerful he is!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:32.84,0:14:33.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:33.94,0:14:36.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give me a status report on what's left of\Nthe train.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:36.04,0:14:36.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:37.01,0:14:38.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As of now, in addition\Nto the engine room,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:38.81,0:14:40.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,there are five cars\Nstill with us.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:40.68,0:14:43.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All of the military in the fifth car have\Nbeen taken out.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:43.88,0:14:47.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That leaves Wanze\Nguarding the fourth car.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.39,0:14:49.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nero on duty in the third car.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:49.52,0:14:51.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nico Robin up in the first car.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:52.25,0:14:55.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And everyone here\Nin the second car.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:55.37,0:14:58.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It seems our enemy is not to be taken\Nlightly.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:58.41,0:15:00.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,However, the only\Nproblem that concerns me
Dialogue: 50,0:15:00.38,0:15:02.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,in our current situation is that
Dialogue: 50,0:15:02.48,0:15:05.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky is walking\Naround this train free.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:05.72,0:15:08.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our mission was to take\NFranky and Nico Robin
Dialogue: 50,0:15:08.32,0:15:12.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,into custody and then deliver\Nthem securely to Enies Lobby.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:12.33,0:15:13.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As long as we accomplish that,
Dialogue: 50,0:15:13.69,0:15:15.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't care how\Nmany men we lose
Dialogue: 50,0:15:15.86,0:15:18.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,or how we take care\Nof our enemies.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:18.40,0:15:20.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That has no bearing on our mission.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:20.64,0:15:23.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And were you able to identify the\Nintruders?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:23.54,0:15:24.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:24.64,0:15:26.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,First, there are the two men\Nthat we had in custody
Dialogue: 50,0:15:26.45,0:15:28.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but now it seem\Nthat one of those two
Dialogue: 50,0:15:28.21,0:15:30.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,is wearing some sort\Nof strange mask.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:30.12,0:15:31.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's also a\Nblond guy in a suit
Dialogue: 50,0:15:31.48,0:15:32.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that we've never seen before,
Dialogue: 50,0:15:33.16,0:15:34.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,making a total of\Nthree intruders!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:35.49,0:15:37.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's probably a member\Nof the Straw Hat pirates,
Dialogue: 50,0:15:37.68,0:15:40.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,just like that\Nlong-nosed man is.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:40.59,0:15:44.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Naturally, their purpose here is to rescue\NNico Robin.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:44.13,0:15:45.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And, since they freed him,
Dialogue: 50,0:15:45.53,0:15:48.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky's decided\Nto help them out.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:48.43,0:15:50.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey Lucci, would\Nyou like me to go
Dialogue: 50,0:15:50.37,0:15:52.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and keep an eye on Nico Robin?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:52.60,0:15:54.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's not necessary.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:54.14,0:15:56.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just stay focused on recapturing Franky.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:56.34,0:15:58.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nothing else matters here.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:58.78,0:16:02.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, they want to take Nico Robin back,\Ndo they?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:02.34,0:16:07.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry to break it to them but\Nthat's just not gonna happen.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:07.61,0:16:13.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't let you pass through!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:13.93,0:16:16.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kneading the high quality flour.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:16.66,0:16:18.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is he gonna bring out\Nthe ramen noodles again?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:19.20,0:16:21.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Ramen Beam!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:25.34,0:16:26.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those are sharp!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:31.25,0:16:32.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.39,0:16:38.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cut it out!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:41.33,0:16:42.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's head over on the roof.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:42.93,0:16:44.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh, right!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:44.90,0:16:47.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll leave it to you then,\NSanji! Best of luck!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:49.04,0:16:50.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:50.44,0:16:53.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're go-go-go-go gone!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:53.57,0:16:55.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I suppose\Nthat's no big deal.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:55.98,0:16:57.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Cause the person\Nwaiting for them
Dialogue: 50,0:16:57.44,0:16:59.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,in the next car is\None tough customer!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:59.37,0:17:00.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nero!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:00.31,0:17:02.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's the latest addition to CP9!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:02.08,0:17:03.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,An assassin for justice!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:03.91,0:17:05.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those two are dead meat!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:05.31,0:17:08.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If there's one thing that Nero loves to\Ndo, it's kill!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:08.18,0:17:10.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:10.92,0:17:12.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Flanchet...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:14.22,0:17:16.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}...Shoot!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:17.17,0:17:20.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I told you, I'm in a hurry here.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:20.88,0:17:22.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay then!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:22.31,0:17:23.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fine!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:23.01,0:17:25.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Ramen Kenpo: Noodle Slicer!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.41,0:17:33.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Fire Skate Blades!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:45.46,0:17:48.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not only did you disrespect\Nmy beautiful attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.06,0:17:51.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you kicked me\Nten times, didn't you?!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:51.87,0:17:53.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Actually, it was twelve times.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:53.87,0:17:55.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:55.10,0:17:58.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you secretly super strong or\Nsomething?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:58.05,0:17:59.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not really a secret.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:59.25,0:18:01.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe you're just super weak.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:01.12,0:18:02.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Super weak?!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:02.32,0:18:05.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not even my old man would say something\Nlike that to me!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:05.46,0:18:06.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:06.49,0:18:07.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm Wanze!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:07.32,0:18:09.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't let you get away with this!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:09.56,0:18:10.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rude!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:10.76,0:18:13.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Besides, I was simply distracted by your\Nswirling eyebrows.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:13.54,0:18:14.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They make me dizzy!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:14.64,0:18:15.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's why I fell for your attack.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:15.82,0:18:18.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Still, you're a good fighter!\NToo bad you look weird!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:18.65,0:18:19.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, you freak!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:19.73,0:18:23.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're in no position to\Ncall anyone weird looking!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:25.87,0:18:28.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After that failed attack, I feel\Nlike I need to prove myself!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:28.70,0:18:31.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So I'm gonna show\Nyou something amazing!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:31.03,0:18:34.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is why I was chosen to escort those\Ncriminals!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:45.95,0:18:49.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Ramen Kenpo: Secret Technique!\NRamen Kenpo: Secret Technique!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.68,0:18:54.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beat the dough, pull the dough!\NBeat the dough, pull the dough!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:55.66,0:18:57.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell is all that?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:57.18,0:19:01.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's my incredible,\Nedible, combat uniform!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:03.66,0:19:05.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Ramen's Formal Suit!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:05.96,0:19:07.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Nooow fight!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:07.72,0:19:09.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go, goooo!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:09.22,0:19:11.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go! The secret of this\NRamen Kenpo technique
Dialogue: 50,0:19:11.23,0:19:14.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,is controlling the free\Nmoving noodles at will!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:14.53,0:19:15.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:15.53,0:19:16.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bastard.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:16.63,0:19:19.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How dare you disgrace\Nfood like that, you wierdo!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:19.89,0:19:23.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My speed, my power,\Nand my special abilities.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:23.95,0:19:27.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm at a different level\Nnow in all of those areas!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:29.12,0:19:32.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If showing you isn't enough,\NI'm gonna beat it into you!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:32.36,0:19:34.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:35.53,0:19:38.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just shut up already\Nand get on with it!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:38.76,0:19:40.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But prepare yourself,\N'cause I'm gonna make you
Dialogue: 50,0:19:40.73,0:19:43.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,eat every last one\Nof those noodles.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:48.39,0:19:49.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Question.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:51.39,0:19:54.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who are you and what\Nare you doing up here?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:55.70,0:19:58.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The officer in charge of the third car.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:58.10,0:20:01.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A Four Powers master\Nand a new recruit in CP9.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:01.64,0:20:04.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The sea weasel, Nero.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.37,0:20:06.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:06.07,0:20:09.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm under specific\Norders not to kill you.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:11.08,0:20:12.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You know, you being one of
Dialogue: 50,0:20:12.13,0:20:14.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,our most important\Ncriminals and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.86,0:20:15.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:15.75,0:20:16.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's one half.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:17.10,0:20:19.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now tell me what you're doing up\Nhere on the roof of this train!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:20.02,0:20:22.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you had just waited inside,\NI would've come to you!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:22.42,0:20:24.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, how was I supposed to know that?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:24.62,0:20:27.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You may have tried to cheat and skip right\Npast this car.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:28.83,0:20:30.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My, my, my!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:30.16,0:20:32.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's rather cautious of you!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:32.06,0:20:33.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But in your line of work,
Dialogue: 50,0:20:33.08,0:20:36.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you always gotta keep\Nyour guard up, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:36.25,0:20:40.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,64)}By the way, what's that weird looking\Nthing there behind you?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:49.43,0:20:51.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That was a dirty trick!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:54.57,0:20:56.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course it was!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.07,0:20:57.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They don't call me
Dialogue: 50,0:20:57.08,0:21:00.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the King of Water Seven's\NUnderworld for nothing!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:03.46,0:21:05.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Don't let me down, octo shoes.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:22.68,0:21:25.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Long Nose?! Is that you?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:28.18,0:21:31.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?!
